@host = http://localhost:5251

### ==================== STREAMING ====================

### Server-Sent Events (10 events, 1s apart). Resume with Last-Event-ID.
GET {{host}}/api/stream/sse?count=5&interval=500
Accept: text/event-stream

### SSE resume after event 3
GET {{host}}/api/stream/sse?count=5&interval=200
Accept: text/event-stream
Last-Event-ID: 3

### SSE stock ticker
GET {{host}}/api/stream/sse/stock?count=5&interval=500

### Newline-delimited JSON
GET {{host}}/api/stream/ndjson/20?intervalMs=50

### Chunked transfer encoding
GET {{host}}/api/stream/chunked/5?intervalMs=300

### Drip 20 bytes over 2 seconds
GET {{host}}/api/stream/drip?durationMs=2000&bytes=20

### Streamed JSON array
GET {{host}}/api/stream/json-array/10?intervalMs=100

### ==================== WEBSOCKETS ====================
# Connect with a WebSocket client:
#   ws://localhost:5251/ws/echo          (send "close" to disconnect)
#   ws://localhost:5251/ws/ticker?count=10

### Plain HTTP to a WebSocket endpoint -> 400 with instructions
GET {{host}}/ws/echo

### ==================== ASYNC JOBS ====================

### Start a job -> 202 Accepted + Location + Retry-After
POST {{host}}/api/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "report", "durationSeconds": 10 }

### Job that fails at 60%
POST {{host}}/api/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "fail", "durationSeconds": 5 }

### List jobs (optional ?status=queued|running|completed|failed|cancelled)
GET {{host}}/api/jobs

### Poll status (seed job)
GET {{host}}/api/jobs/job_0001

### Result (409 while queued/running)
GET {{host}}/api/jobs/job_0001/result

### Cancel
DELETE {{host}}/api/jobs/job_1001

### ==================== PAGINATION STYLES ====================

### Offset / limit
GET {{host}}/api/pagination/offset?offset=20&limit=10

### Spring page envelope (0-based)
GET {{host}}/api/pagination/page?page=2&size=10

### Stripe-style cursor (pass next_cursor back as ?cursor=)
GET {{host}}/api/pagination/cursor?limit=5

### GitHub-style Link header (1-based)
GET {{host}}/api/pagination/link?page=2&per_page=10

### Keyset
GET {{host}}/api/pagination/keyset?after_id=40&limit=10

### HAL (_embedded / _links)
GET {{host}}/api/pagination/hal?page=1&size=5

### Single item
GET {{host}}/api/pagination/items/42

### ==================== CHAOS ====================

### Random failures (503 with probability failRate)
GET {{host}}/api/chaos/flaky?failRate=0.5

### Fail the first 3 attempts for this key, then succeed
GET {{host}}/api/chaos/retry/my-test?succeedAfter=3&failStatus=503

### Reset the retry counter
DELETE {{host}}/api/chaos/retry/my-test

### Random wait between minMs and maxMs (cap 30s)
GET {{host}}/api/chaos/slow?minMs=500&maxMs=2000

### Hang for N seconds, then answer (cap 60s)
GET {{host}}/api/chaos/timeout?seconds=5

### Realistic latency distribution (p90 fast, p99 slow)
GET {{host}}/api/chaos/random-latency

### Connection dropped with no response
GET {{host}}/api/chaos/abort

### Truncated body, then connection dropped
GET {{host}}/api/chaos/partial

### Many large response headers
GET {{host}}/api/chaos/huge-headers?count=50&size=200

### ==================== WEBHOOKS ====================

### Create a bin
POST {{host}}/api/webhooks/bins
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "my-bin" }

### List bins
GET {{host}}/api/webhooks/bins

### Send something to a bin (replace BIN_ID); any verb and sub-path work, ?status= sets the reply code
POST {{host}}/api/webhooks/BIN_ID/orders/created?status=202
Content-Type: application/json
X-Custom-Header: hello

{ "event": "order.created", "orderId": 1001 }

### Inspect captured requests
GET {{host}}/api/webhooks/bins/BIN_ID

### Clear captured requests
DELETE {{host}}/api/webhooks/bins/BIN_ID/requests

### Delete bin
DELETE {{host}}/api/webhooks/bins/BIN_ID

### Sample signed events
GET {{host}}/api/webhooks/samples

### Stripe sample (raw body + Stripe-Signature header)
GET {{host}}/api/webhooks/samples/stripe

### GitHub sample as a JSON envelope
GET {{host}}/api/webhooks/samples/github?format=envelope

### Shopify sample
GET {{host}}/api/webhooks/samples/shopify

### ==================== VERSIONING ====================

### Supported versions
GET {{host}}/api/versions

### Path v1 (Deprecation / Sunset / Link headers)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/profile

### Path v2
GET {{host}}/api/v2/profile

### Header
GET {{host}}/api/versioned/profile
X-API-Version: 1

### Query
GET {{host}}/api/versioned/profile?api-version=2.0

### Media type
GET {{host}}/api/versioned/profile
Accept: application/vnd.apibee.v1+json

### Unsupported -> 400
GET {{host}}/api/versioned/profile?api-version=3

### ==================== SOAP ====================

### WSDL
GET {{host}}/api/soap/calculator?wsdl

### Usage + sample envelopes
GET {{host}}/api/soap/calculator

### SOAP 1.1 Add
POST {{host}}/api/soap/calculator
Content-Type: text/xml; charset=utf-8
SOAPAction: "http://tempuri.org/Add"

<soap:Envelope xmlns:soap="http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/">
  <soap:Body>
    <Add xmlns="http://tempuri.org/"><intA>5</intA><intB>3</intB></Add>
  </soap:Body>
</soap:Envelope>

### SOAP 1.2 Divide by zero -> Fault
POST {{host}}/api/soap/calculator
Content-Type: application/soap+xml; charset=utf-8

<soap:Envelope xmlns:soap="http://www.w3.org/2003/05/soap-envelope">
  <soap:Body>
    <Divide xmlns="http://tempuri.org/"><intA>10</intA><intB>0</intB></Divide>
  </soap:Body>
</soap:Envelope>

### Countries: GetCountryInfo
POST {{host}}/api/soap/countries
Content-Type: text/xml; charset=utf-8
SOAPAction: "http://apibee.dev/countries/GetCountryInfo"

<soap:Envelope xmlns:soap="http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/">
  <soap:Body>
    <GetCountryInfo xmlns="http://apibee.dev/countries"><countryCode>IN</countryCode></GetCountryInfo>
  </soap:Body>
</soap:Envelope>

### Countries: ListCountries
POST {{host}}/api/soap/countries
Content-Type: text/xml; charset=utf-8

<soap:Envelope xmlns:soap="http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/">
  <soap:Body><ListCountries xmlns="http://apibee.dev/countries"/></soap:Body>
</soap:Envelope>

### ==================== VALIDATION ====================

### Valid registration -> 201
POST {{host}}/api/validation/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "ava_t",
  "email": "ava@example.com",
  "password": "Str0ng!Pass",
  "confirmPassword": "Str0ng!Pass",
  "age": 29,
  "country": "US",
  "phone": "+15550101",
  "acceptTerms": true
}

### Invalid registration -> 422 problem+json
POST {{host}}/api/validation/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "email": "not-an-email", "password": "weak", "age": "abc", "country": "XX", "acceptTerms": false }

### Strict: unknown field -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/validation/strict
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Widget", "email": "a@b.co", "quantity": 2, "colour": "red" }

### Strict: valid -> 200
POST {{host}}/api/validation/strict
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Widget", "email": "a@b.co", "quantity": 2 }

### DataAnnotations -> framework automatic 400
POST {{host}}/api/validation/annotations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "ab", "email": "nope", "age": 12, "countryCode": "usa", "website": "not a url" }

### Problem document types
GET {{host}}/api/validation/problem

### Sample problem document
GET {{host}}/api/validation/problem/rate-limited
